## 3 and 4. the trap sentences under the other switches (F-11 B)
| switches | said | did | verdict |
|---|---|---|---|
| kg required · band hidden (the twenty above) | Log my weight. | no call | right |
| kg required · band hidden (the twenty above) | Log my weight as heavy. | no call | right |
| kg OPTIONAL · band hidden | Log my weight. | no call | right |
| kg OPTIONAL · band hidden | Log my weight as heavy. | log_weight(note: "heavy") | right (call, no number) |
| kg required · band SHOWN 20…400 | Log my weight. | no call | right |
| kg required · band SHOWN 20…400 | Log my weight as heavy. | no call | right |
| kg OPTIONAL · band SHOWN 20…400 | Log my weight. | no call | right |
| kg OPTIONAL · band SHOWN 20…400 | Log my weight as heavy. | no call | right |

required = a demand the model meets from nothing; a band SHOWN under constrained decoding
turns a catchable 0 into an uncatchable 75 — the two cautions of F-11 B, measured.

